      "text": "R0 still has only #0.\nSaved result still contains s1.\nLookups never advance next.\n\nPOST occupies #1 even when\nGET skips it. Each branch has\nits own registration history.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
